{"verse_key": "34:49", "surah": 34, "verse": 49, "text_uthmani": "قُلْ جَآءَ ٱلْحَقُّ وَمَا يُبْدِئُ ٱلْبَـٰطِلُ وَمَا يُعِيدُ", "translation": "Say, \"The truth has come, and falsehood can neither begin [anything] nor repeat [it].\"<sup foot_note=197133>1</sup>", "verse_from_ms": 985990, "verse_to_ms": 1001450, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/34.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "قُلْ", "start_ms": 985990, "end_ms": 986550}, {"i": 1, "text": "جَآءَ", "start_ms": 986550, "end_ms": 987420}, {"i": 2, "text": "ٱلْحَقُّ", "start_ms": 987420, "end_ms": 988630}, {"i": 3, "text": "وَمَا", "start_ms": 988630, "end_ms": 989780}, {"i": 4, "text": "يُبْدِئُ", "start_ms": 989780, "end_ms": 992410}, {"i": 5, "text": "ٱلْبَـٰطِلُ", "start_ms": 992410, "end_ms": 993440}, {"i": 6, "text": "وَمَا", "start_ms": 993440, "end_ms": 994240}, {"i": 7, "text": "يُعِيدُ", "start_ms": 994240, "end_ms": 995150}]}